🧪 ตัวอย่างการซ่อม

Before — post-comment.yml (dedent)

yaml
- name: Post comment
  uses: actions/github-script@v7
  with:
    script: |
      const marker = '<!-- bot -->';
      const body = `
        ## Report
const marker = 'XXX';
        More text
      `;


After:

yaml
- name: Post comment
  uses: actions/github-script@v7
  with:
    script: |
      const marker = '<!-- bot -->';
      const body = `
        ## Report
        const marker = 'XXX';
        More text
      `.replace(/^ {8}/gm, '');


───

Before — post-or-update-comment.yml (fragment)

yaml
- name: Post or update comment
  uses: actions/github-script@v7
  with:
    github-token: `${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}
    script: |
      // ...


After:

yaml
name: Post or update comment

on:
  workflow_call:
    secrets:
      GITHUB_TOKEN:
        required: true

jobs:
  run:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: Post or update comment
        uses: actions/github-script@v7
        with:
          github-token: $`{{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}
          script: |
            // ...


───

Before — deploy.yml (chat)

จัดให้ตามคำขอครับ! ผมได้นำขั้นตอน...

```yaml
name: Deploy
on: [push]
jobs:
  deploy:
    steps:
      - run: |
          curl -X POST https://api.line.me \\
            -H "Auth: `${{ secrets.LINE }}" \\
            -d "message=Deploy"

หวังว่าจะเป็นประโยชน์นะครับ!
<br>

**After:**
```yaml
name: Deploy
on: [push]
jobs:
  deploy:
    steps:
      - run: |
          curl -X POST https://api.line.me \
            -H "Auth: ${{ secrets.LINE }}" \
            -d "message=Deploy"


